From 9d83d4078bb66b098222c0e7b8741763db4130e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vivan <pesu1ug23am354@pesu.pesu.edu>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:10:49 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] feat(research_v2): Phase 4B canonical harmonization,
 feature store v2, and quality gates

- Task A1: Confirmed raw DAIC-WOZ audio (XXX_AUDIO.wav) is unrecoverable locally; prespecified acoustic_robust_135d as primary representation.
- Task A2: Dropped 19 amplitude- and pause-dependent acoustic features; evaluated 5-fold grouped CV domain-AUC on dev (Full 154d: 0.8238, Robust 135d: 0.8070, Wav2Vec2: 0.6899); disclosed residual acoustic shift.
- Task A3: Benchmarked Whisper ASR on sealed E-DAIC 24 sessions (Whisper-tiny WER = 28.07% at 11.8x RT on MPS within 8 GB RAM); audited avatar setup boundaries (37 accepted/trimmed, 24 undetected); updated text normalizer to preserve apostrophes; evaluated BERT T1 domain-AUC (0.9994).
- Task A4: Feature store v2 covers 272 sessions (178 WoZ dev, 61 avatar dev, 33 sealed label-blind) with complete SHA-256 manifest.
- Task A5: Verified all quality gates (zero zero-padded dims, zero constant dims, cross-session Wav2Vec2 cosine = 0.9988, loader default to v2); all 29 unit tests passing.
- Task A6: Authored reports/research_v2/PHASE4B_HARMONIZATION.md; cleaned README.md of old benchmark table and leak-free claims.
